48
00:02:07,903 --> 00:02:10,064
and from other load balancers,

49
00:02:10,064 --> 00:02:13,307
Anaya L B included, through a common adapter.

50
00:02:13,307 --> 00:02:15,685
The Cisco A P I C tells you where

51
00:02:15,685 --> 00:02:17,918
a path enters the A C I fabric.

52
00:02:17,918 --> 00:02:22,674
Then Claude writes Mermaid. A deterministic renderer validates the

53
00:02:22,674 --> 00:02:25,916
syntax, every node carries the probe I D that

54
00:02:25,916 --> 00:02:29,735
placed it, and unknown segments are drawn as unknown.

55
00:02:30,485 --> 00:02:32,686
Then the module most teams skip.

56
00:02:32,686 --> 00:02:36,881
Guardrails. Probe targets are restricted to an approved scope

57
00:02:36,881 --> 00:02:39,975
list, enforced in code and not in the prompt.

58
00:02:39,975 --> 00:02:43,895
Rate limits and probe budgets keep automated tracing from

59
00:02:43,895 --> 00:02:46,783
becoming a ping storm on production links.

60
00:02:46,783 --> 00:02:48,983
Any diagram going to the C M D B

61
00:02:48,983 --> 00:02:52,490
or into a shared repository needs a named approver,

62
00:02:52,490 --> 00:02:56,066
and every tool call, device query and decision lands

63
00:02:56,066 --> 00:02:58,335
in an audit log you can hand to a

64
00:02:58,335 --> 00:02:58,954
reviewer.

65
00:02:59,704 --> 00:03:03,036
Day three is publishing. The result is written to

66
00:03:03,036 --> 00:03:07,183
the ServiceNow incident, change or request record through the

67
00:03:07,183 --> 00:03:09,698
Table A P I, with the diagram and its

68
00:03:09,698 --> 00:03:13,370
evidence bundle attached through the Attachment A P I,

69
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:16,089
and Flow Designer starting the pipeline.

70
00:03:16,089 --> 00:03:19,284
A GitHub pull request carries the Mermaid file,

71
00:03:19,284 --> 00:03:22,004
the evidence and a summary Claude wrote,

72
00:03:22,004 --> 00:03:24,383
and a person reviews and merges it.

73
00:03:25,133 --> 00:03:28,774
Then drift. A GitHub Actions schedule re-runs the probes

74
00:03:28,774 --> 00:03:32,285
