75
00:03:32,285 --> 00:03:34,950
one, and opens a pull request with a diff

76
00:03:34,950 --> 00:03:38,981
only when something changed. Claude explains the difference in

77
00:03:38,981 --> 00:03:41,971
plain language. You decide what to do with it.

78
00:03:41,971 --> 00:03:44,182
The capstone ties it all together,

79
00:03:44,182 --> 00:03:46,327
from request to approved diagram,

80
00:03:46,327 --> 00:03:49,512
with nothing published that a person did not sign

81
00:03:49,512 --> 00:03:49,772
off.

82
00:03:50,522 --> 00:03:53,869
Every lab runs in a contained environment with lab

83
